==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|какъ||ru-PRO}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|кəк}}
* {{ru-IPA|кɐк}} {{q|before a stressed syllable}}
* {{ru-IPA}} {{q|when stressed}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-как.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-как.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Etymology 1===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*kʷ-}}{{dercat|ru|ine-bsl-pro}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|како}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*kako}}.

====Adverb====
{{ru-adv|как}}

# {{lb|ru|with a {{lg|verb}} or [[short form#English:_Q4239848|short-form]] {{lg|adjective}}, which can be implied and omitted}} [[how]] {{gl|in what way, in what manner}} {{q|translated as "[[what]]" with some verbs}}
#: {{syn|ru|каки́м о́бразом}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[он]] [[э́то]] [[сде́лал]]?|'''How''' did he do that?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[как дела|'''Как''' дела́]]?|'''How''' are things?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[пройти́]] [[на]] [[по́чту]]?|'''How''' can I get to the post office?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[вас]] [[зову́т]]?|What's your name?|lit='''How''' do (they/people) call you?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[ва́ша]] [[фами́лия]]?|t=What's your surname?|lit='''How''' does your surname (go/sound/etc.)?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[э́то]] [[бу́дет]] [[по-ру́сски]] / [[на]] [[ру́сском]]?|t='''What'''<nowiki/>'s that in Russian? / '''What''' would that be in Russian?|lit='''How''' will that be in Russian?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[вы]] [[э́то]] [[называ́ете]]?|t='''What''' do you call this?|lit='''How''' do you call this?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[ты]] [[ду́маешь]], [[что]] [[он]] [[де́лает]]?|What do you think he's doing?|lit='''How''' do you think, what is he doing?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[расположенный|располо́жены]] [[зда́ния]]?|'''How''' are the buildings situated?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[была́]] [[проведённый|проведена́]] [[процеду́ра]]?|'''How''' was the procedure conducted?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[не]] [[зна́ю]], '''как''' [[э́то]] [[рабо́тает]].|I don't know '''how''' this works.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[не]] [[зна́ю]], '''как''' [[он]] [[э́то]] [[сде́лал]].|I don’t know '''how''' he did it.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[забы́л]], '''как''' [[э́то]] [[называ́ется]].|t=I forgot '''what''' that's called.|lit=I forgot '''how''' that's called.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[мне|Мне]] [[не]] [[нра́вится]], '''как''' [[он]] [[поступи́л]].|I don't like '''what''' he did.|lit=I don't like '''how''' he acted/behaved/did things.}}
# {{sid|ru|what degree}} {{lb|ru|with an {{lg|adverb}} or [[short form#English:_Q4239848|short-form]] {{lg|adjective}}}} [[how]] {{gl|to what extent/degree}}
#: {{syn|ru|како́й<q:with a long-form adjective; must be declined><id:what degree>|наско́лько|сколь}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[далеко́]] [[он]] [[ушёл]]?|'''How''' far did he go?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[до́лго]] [[э́то]] [[продолжа́ется]]?|'''How''' long has this been going on?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[не]] [[знал]], '''как''' [[э́то]] [[ва́жно]] [[для]] [[них]].|I didn't know '''how''' important it was for them.}}
# {{sid|ru|exclamative}} {{lb|ru|[[exclamative#English|exclamative]]|with an {{lg|adverb}} or [[short form#English:_Q4239848|short-form]] {{lg|adjective}}}} [[how]] {{gl|to a significant extent/degree}} ({{n-g|used to indicate surprise, delight or horror}})
#: {{syn|ru|како́й<q:with a long-form adjective; must be declined><id:exclamative>|наско́лько|сколь}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[здо́рово]]!|'''How''' great!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[ужа́сно]]!|'''How''' horrible!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[бы́стро]] [[он]] [[бежи́т]]!|'''How''' fast he runs!}}
# {{lb|ru|[[concessive#English|concessive]]|with {{m|ru|ни}} and a [[short form#English:_Q4239848|short-form]] {{lg|adjective}}, {{lg|adverb}} or {{lg|verb}}}} [[as]], [[however]], [[however]] [[much]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[он]] [[ни]] [[умён]]...|t=Clever as he is...}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[ни]] [[стра́нно]]...|t=As strange as it may seem... / Oddly enough...}}
# {{lb|ru|between same-tense verbs}} [[as soon as]], [[when]]
#: {{syn|ru|как то́лько|когда́}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[прие́ду]], '''как''' [[смогу́]].|I'll come '''as soon as''' I can.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[отпра́влю]] [[тебе́]] [[фо́тку]], '''как''' [[уви́жу]] [[его́]].|I'll send you a pic '''as soon as''' I see it.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[останови́лся]], '''как''' [[услы́шал]] [[его́]] [[го́лос]].|I stopped '''as soon as''' I heard his voice.}}
# {{lb|ru|after a phrase about passed time and before a verbal phrase}} [[since]] (the last time something happened)
#: {{syn|ru|с тех по́р, как|с того́ вре́мени, как|с того́ моме́нта, как}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[прошёл|Прошёл]] [[год]], '''как''' [[мы]] [[ви́делись]].|It's been a year '''since''' we've seen each other.}}
# {{lb|ru|in the following construction with {{m|ru|так}} and {{m|ru|и}}}} [[both]] (''or not translated'')
#: {{syn|ru|[[и]] ..., [[и]] ...}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[прино́сит]] [[по́льзу]] '''как''' [[молоды́м]], [[так]] [[и]] [[ста́рым]].|This benefits '''both''' the young and the old.|lit=This brings benefit in the same way (it does) to the old '''as''' (it does) to the young too.}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial|with a conjugated {{lg|perfective}} verb}} [[suddenly]], [[all of a sudden]] (in the past)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Как''' [[он]] [[вско́чит]]!|All of a sudden, he jumped up!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] '''как''' [[закричи́т]]!|He suddenly started shouting/screaming!}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col4|ru
|ещё как
}}

====Conjunction====
{{head|ru|conjunction}}

# [[like]] {{gl|in the same manner as / a similar manner to}}; {{n-g|occasionally ''[[as]]''}}
#: {{syn|ru|а́ки<q:archaic>|бу́дто|сло́вно|я́ко<q:dated>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[она|Она́]] [[вы́глядит]] '''как''' [[знамени́тость]].|She looks '''like''' a celebrity.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[звук|Звук]] «[[г]]», '''как''' [[в]] [[сло́ве]] «good».|The sound "g", '''like'''/'''as''' in the word "good".}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[относи́лся]] [[к]] [[э́тому]] '''как''' [[к]] [[рабо́те]].|He treated it '''like'''/'''as''' a job.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[широ́кий]] '''как''' [[мо́ре]]|wide '''like''' the sea / (as) wide '''as''' the sea}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[будьте|Бу́дьте]] '''как''' [[до́ма]].|Make yourself at home.|lit=Be '''like''' at home.}}
# [[as]] {{gl|in the capacity/role of}}
#: {{syn|ru|бу́дучи<qq:about the subject only>|в ка́честве}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в настоящее время|В настоя́щее вре́мя]] [[дом]] [[функциони́рует]] '''как''' [[музе́й]].|The house now functions '''as''' a museum.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[говорю́]] [[э́то]] '''как''' [[челове́к]], [[кото́рый]] [[хо́чет]] [[помога́ть]] [[други́м]].|I say this '''as''' a man who wants to help others.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[люблю́]] [[её]] '''как''' [[челове́ка]].|I love her '''as''' a person.}}
# [[as]], [[since]] {{gl|because, due to the fact that}}
#: {{syn|ru|так как<qq:more common>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[и|И]] '''как''' [[он]] [[до́лго]] [[не]] [[приходи́л]], [[обе́дать]] [[ста́ли]] [[без]] [[него́]].|And '''since''' he hadn't arrived for a long time, they began to have lunch without him.}}
# {{lb|ru|when beginning a clause after {{m|ru|[[так]] ([[же]])}} + a [[short form#English:_Q4239848|short-form]] {{lg|adjective}} or {{lg|adverb}}}} [[as]] ({{n-g|introducing an object or scenario of comparison}})
#: {{uxi|ru|[[их|Они́]] [[так]] ([[же]]) [[краси́вы]], '''как''' [[на]] [[фотогра́фиях]].|They're as beautiful '''as''' (they are) on the photos.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[их|Их]] [[не]] [[так]] [[мно́го]], '''как''' [[ка́жется]].|There aren't as many of them '''as''' it seems.}}
# {{lb|ru|when beginning a clause after a {{lg|verb}} or [[short form#English:_Q4239848|short-form]] {{lg|adjective}} + {{m|ru|[[так]] ([[же]])}}}} [[as]] ({{n-g|introducing an object or scenario of comparison; can also be "[[how]]" + {{lg|pronoun}} + {{lg|verb}} in this case, or even just "[[how]]", if a verb and pronoun already exist}})
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Она́]] [[звучи́т]] [[так]] ([[же]]), '''как''' [[в]] [[фи́льмах]].|She sounds the same as / like (she does) in the films. / She sounds (like) '''how''' she does in the films.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] [[расположенный|располо́жены]] [[так]] ([[же]]), '''как''' [[на]] [[схе́ме]].|They are positioned as/like (they are) on the diagram. / They are positioned (like) '''how''' they are on the diagram. / They are positioned (in) the same way '''as''' on the diagram.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] [[говоря́т]] [[не]] [[так]], '''как''' [[говори́м]] [[мы]].|They don't talk (like) '''how''' we talk. / They don't talk like we talk.}}
# {{n-g|Used to connect a verb of perception (see, hear etc.) with a verb phrase describing an action being perceived. Usually not translated, but can sometimes be translated as "[[how]]". Sometimes, {{m|ru|что}} can be used in place of {{m-self|ru|как}}, but this has a different meaning and is usually translated as "[[that]]".}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[подслу́шал]], '''как''' [[он]] [[говори́л]] [[с]] [[мое́й]] [[сестро́й]].|I overheard him talking to my sister.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[ви́дела]], '''как''' [[она́]] [[ходи́ла]] [[за]] [[ним]] [[в]] [[шко́ле]].|I saw her following him around in school.|lit=I saw '''how''' she was following him around in school.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[по́мню]], '''как''' [[она́]] [[пла́кала]] [[в]] [[раздева́лке]].|I remember her crying in the changing room.|lit=I remember '''how''' she was crying in the changing room.}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial|between a duplicated noun}} {{n-g|Used to emphasise the insignificance of something, that something isn't special.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[в|В]] [[рука́х]] Мо́ны Ли́зы [[нет]] [[ничего́]] [[необычный|необы́чного]]. [[руки|Ру́ки]] '''как''' [[ру́ки]].|There's nothing unusual about the Mona Lisa's hands. They're just hands.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[пацан|Паца́н]] '''как''' [[паца́н]], [[норма́льный]] [[ма́льчик]].|He's just a guy, a normal boy.}}
# {{lb|ru|with a negative or [[interrogative#English|interrogative]]}} [[except]], [[besides]], [[other than]]
#: {{syn|ru|кро́ме}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[больше|Бо́льше]] [[не́кому]], '''как''' [[тебе́]].|There's no one '''but''' you.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[кто|Кто]], '''как''' [[не]] [[мы]]?|Who else, '''if not''' us?}}

